
Ultra Burst
^Y_+^Z (While not in hit stun)
Health Based Buff that knocks up on activation.

Burst
^Y_+^Z (While in hit stun)
Non damaging blast around your character that knocks back. 

Dodge
^Y/_F_+^Y/_B_+^Y
Become invulnerable and can pass through the opponent and attacks.  

Rapid Cancel
^X/_F_+^X/_B_+^X/_U_+^X/_D_+^X
Using this will immediately put you in a neutral state.

Guard Reject
_F_+^X (While Blocking)
Cancels your guard animation into an invulnerable knock back.

